class_name CodexLore

# =========================================================
# Background write-ups for the Codex. Save as
#   res://systems/codex_lore.gd
#
# PARTNERS is keyed by character family (see PartnerSkills.FAMILIES),
# so every form of a character shares one background, or by partner
# id for characters with a single form. [series, background];
# series "" means the background was written for the game.
# =========================================================

const PARTNERS := {
	"wang_lin": ["Renegade Immortal", "A boy of ordinary talent from a small mountain village, turned away by the sects he dreamed of joining. A mysterious bead and a sealed master's soul changed everything, but it was his patience and ruthlessness that carried him forward. He cuts down anyone who threatens the few people he loves, and walks the renegade's road against heaven itself."],
	"xiao_yan": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "Once hailed as the Xiao clan's genius, he mysteriously lost his power and became the family's shame. The cause was a legendary alchemist's soul sleeping in his mother's ring, who became his teacher. Mocked and even rejected by his fiancée, he rebuilt his strength, hunted the rare Heavenly Flames and learned to fuse them into devastating lotus fire."],
	"shi_hao": ["Perfect World", "Born into a great clan, he had his supreme bone torn out as a baby and was left to die. Stone Village took him in, and an ancient willow tree watched over him as he grew up among the beasts of the Great Wilderness. Tough, cheeky and fearless, he fought his way from the village to the heavens, refusing to bow to fate, clans or immortals."],
	"han_li": ["A Record of a Mortal's Journey to Immortality", "A farmer's son from a poor village with mediocre talent and no backing. His secret weapon is a mysterious green vial that ripens spirit herbs, and a mind that never stops planning. Where others rely on courage, Han Li relies on caution, preparation and a swarm of green bamboo flying swords, surviving dangers that killed far greater geniuses."],
	"bai_xiaochun": ["A Will Eternal", "Terrified of dying, he joined a sect only because he heard cultivators live forever. He brings chaos wherever he goes: stolen spirit chickens, exploding pills and outrageous schemes. Yet beneath the cowardice is a genuinely kind heart, and a body forged by the Undying Live Forever Art that simply refuses to die when his friends need him."],
	"nie_li": ["Tales of Demons and Gods", "The strongest demon spiritist of his world, killed in the final battle as his city fell to the demon beasts. He woke up in his thirteen-year-old body with every memory of the life that followed. With knowledge no one else has, he sets out to fix his mistakes, protect the people he lost and change the fate of Glory City."],
	"yang_kai": ["Martial Peak", "A lowly sweeping disciple at the bottom of his sect, bullied and overlooked. A mysterious black book and golden dragon blood revealed a talent for fighting that grows sharpest in desperate battle. Stubborn and never willing to back down, he climbed through endless trials towards the very peak of martial arts."],
	"tang_san": ["Soul Land", "A master of hidden weapons from the Tang Sect in another life, reborn as a blacksmith's son in a world of spirit masters. His martial spirit seemed useless Blue Silver Grass, yet he also carried the legendary Clear Sky Hammer. Calm, clever and deadly, he rebuilds the Tang Sect's arsenal in a new world, with Buddha's Wrath Tang Lotus as his most feared weapon."],
	"huo_yuhao": ["Soul Land II: The Unrivaled Tang Sect", "Born the unwanted son of a noble family, he grew up in hardship with only his mother's love. His Spirit Eyes let him see what others miss, and a bond with an Ice Jade Emperor Scorpion gave him extraordinary strength. Gentle yet determined, he becomes a leading figure of the new Tang Sect and a pioneer of spirit engineering."],
	"luo_feng": ["Swallowed Star", "A young man on a future Earth overrun by monsters, working hard to become a warrior and support his family. A chance encounter gave him psychic powers and a path far beyond Earth. From martial student to a lord among the stars, he fights beside his Golden Horned Beast clone to protect his planet and his people."],
	"lin_dong": ["Martial Universe", "A boy from a small clan whose father was crippled by a stronger rival. He found a mysterious stone talisman that accelerates cultivation and hides a greater secret. Driven to restore his family's honour, he rose through the arts of symbols and martial skill to face an invasion threatening his whole world."],
	"mu_chen": ["The Great Ruler", "Son of the ruler of the Northern Spirit Realm, raised to carry a heavy responsibility. His mother's disappearance and his own hidden potential drive him forward, fuelled by the undying Great Sun body and the Nine Nether flames. Steady and proud, he walks towards the Great Ruler's throne with his friends beside him."],
	"qin_yu": ["Stellar Transformations", "A frail prince who could not cultivate inner force, dismissed by those around him. Everything changed when a meteor tear fused with his body and opened the path of star transformation. Kind, determined and loyal to his family, he climbed from a mortal kingdom through immortal and divine realms towards the very origins of the universe."],
	"zhang_xiaofan": ["Jade Dynasty", "A plain village boy whose home was wiped out in a single night, leaving him in the care of the Qingyun Sect. Unremarkable at first, he secretly carries a cursed rod that feeds on blood. Torn between righteous and demonic paths, he becomes Ghost Li, a man whose loyalty and grief are both as deep as the darkness he wields."],
	"meng_chuan": ["Cang Yuan Tu", "A young prodigy of the blade in a world where humanity hides behind city walls from monsters. He trains relentlessly, channelling thunder through his saber, and grows into one of mankind's great protectors. Serious and devoted, he carries the hopes of his family and his people."],
	"lin_qiye": ["Slay the Gods", "Blinded as a child after meeting the gaze of an archangel, he spent years in a mental hospital. When his sight returned, so did a divine domain within his mind that the gods themselves covet. Quiet and protective, he joined the Night Watch to keep the mortal world safe from gods and monsters alike."],
	"medusa": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "The proud queen of the Snake People, as beautiful as she is dangerous. She holds within her the soul of the Seven-Coloured Heaven-Swallowing Python, and her pride matches her power. Her fate becomes bound to Xiao Yan's in ways neither of them expected."],
	"xuner": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "A gentle, graceful girl who grew up alongside Xiao Yan, always calling him her big brother. In truth she is a daughter of the ancient Gu Clan, with one of the most noble bloodlines in the world. Warm towards him and cool towards everyone else, she never wavered in her loyalty."],
	"yun_yun": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "Leader of the Cloud Lan Sect, a graceful master of wind arts and swordplay. Her encounter with Xiao Yan left her torn between her duty to her sect and the wishes of her own heart. Elegant and dignified, she carries great responsibility on her shoulders."],
	"zi_yan": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "A little dragon girl of the Taixu Dragon clan who looks like a child and eats like an army. Her small frame hides crushing strength and a bottomless appetite for medicinal pills. Cheeky and fiercely loyal, she grows into her dragon heritage over the years."],
	"yao_lao": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "A legendary alchemist, once among the greatest of his age, betrayed and left with only his soul. He slept inside a plain black ring until Xiao Yan found him, and became the boy's teacher and protector. Wise, warm and fiercely proud of his student, he eventually regains a body of his own."],
	"bibi_dong": ["Soul Land", "The Pope of the Spirit Hall, one of the most powerful and feared figures of her world. Her spider martial spirits and cold ambition hide a painful past that shaped everything she became. Ruthless towards her enemies, she aims to bring the whole continent under her rule."],
	"qian_renxue": ["Soul Land", "Heir to the Angel God's bloodline and granddaughter of the Spirit Hall's former master. She spent years hidden behind another person's face in a rival empire, carrying out a dangerous plan. Proud and determined, she finally claims her divine inheritance."],
	"long_haochen": ["Throne of Seal", "A young man who trained as a squire in a world under a demon seal, aiming to become a Divine Knight of light. Honest, brave and hard-working, he fights alongside a loyal team against overwhelming demon forces. His light grows until it can shake the demon gods themselves."],
	"sheng_caier": ["Throne of Seal", "A silent, deadly assassin who became Long Haochen's most devoted partner. She strikes from the shadows with speed and precision, protecting him at any cost. Behind her coldness lies an unbreakable loyalty and a fate tied to a holy reincarnation."],
	"abao": ["Throne of Seal", "A demon prince whose life spans two worlds, the demon realm and the human continent. Torn between the blood in his veins and the bonds he has formed, he walks a difficult path. When his demon power awakens fully, few can stand against him."],
	"fang_han": ["Immortality", "A lowly servant looked down on by everyone around him, until he stumbled onto a hidden path to power. He trains with relentless grit, turning every chance into a step forward. From the bottom of society, he climbs steadily towards immortality."],
	"luo_zheng": ["Apotheosis", "Once the heir of a powerful noble family, he lost everything when his clan fell and was sold into slavery. Determined to save his sister and restore his honour, he tempers his body through a hundred refinements. Each step makes him harder, stronger and more unbreakable."],
	"mo_fan": ["Full-Time Magister", "An ordinary high school boy in a world where magic replaced science and mages rule society. He awakened not one but two elements, something almost unheard of, and later far darker powers. Cocky, brave and loyal, he fights monsters and conspiracies alike."],
	"chen_ping_an": ["Sword of Coming", "A poor kiln boy from a small, mysterious town, orphaned young and living by his own steady principles. He carries swords for others and follows a long road across the world, learning its rules and breaking its injustices. Honest, patient and kind, he becomes a swordsman others trust with their lives."],
	"qin_mu": ["Tales of Herding Gods", "An orphan found drifting in a basket and raised by nine disabled elders in a village beyond the Great Ruins. Each elder taught him their unmatched art: medicine, blades, painting, thievery and more. Clever, cheerful and a little mischievous, he sets out into the wider world as the Heavenly Devil Cult's young master."],
	"jing_jiu": ["Path Toward Heaven", "A sword immortal of the Green Mountain who returned from death in a new body. Lazy, quiet and seemingly indifferent, he hides a sword intent sharp enough to cut the heavens. Few understand him, yet those who follow him find a master unlike any other."],
	"wu_geng": ["Wu Geng Ji", "A spoiled prince of a fallen kingdom, forced into the body of a lower-class slave in the mines. He grew tough through hardship, suffering and endless fights. Stubborn and fierce, he rose to lead the Fallen Ones against the gods who conquered his people."],
	"zi_yu": ["Wu Geng Ji", "Wu Geng's uncle and the greatest swordsman under heaven. His Heaven Punisher, a sword made by his own will, can wound even the gods. Proud and principled, he refuses to rely on anyone's power but his own."],
	"ni_tian_er_xing": ["Wu Geng Ji", "A leader of the Fallen Ones' rebellion who carried the hopes of his people for years. Burdened by duty and the weight of war, he saw in Wu Geng the future of the Fallen Ones. He entrusted that future to the young man, trusting him to finish what he started."],
	"baili_dongjun": ["Young Brewmaster's Adventure", "The carefree young master of a wine family, who dreams of brewing the finest wine under heaven. Behind his playfulness lies a remarkable talent for the sword. His journey through the martial world makes him a legend in his own right."],
	"wuxin": ["Great Journey of Teenagers", "A young monk who emerged from a golden coffin, gifted in forbidden arts and ancient secrets. He carries a demonic lineage that the martial world fears and covets. Calm and mysterious, he walks his own path between righteousness and demonhood."],
	"xiao_se": ["Great Journey of Teenagers", "A sharp-tongued innkeeper with a dry sense of humour and a hidden royal past. His damaged meridians once seemed to end his martial path, but he hides a staff art of fearsome power. When forced to act, he reveals why so many still fear his name."],
	"ye_dingzhi": ["Young Brewmaster's Adventure", "Former leader of the Outer Heaven and one of the four great demons of the martial world. His strength and his past make him feared wherever his name is spoken. Yet his story is shaped as much by love and loss as by demonic power."],
	"ye_fan": ["Shrouding the Heavens", "An ordinary student from Earth, carried away by nine dragon corpses dragging a bronze coffin across the stars. On a strange new world, he learned he had the Holy Body, a physique both cursed and destined for greatness. Brave, loyal and quick-witted, he fights his way towards the peak of an ancient universe."],
	"jiang_taixu": ["Shrouding the Heavens", "A legendary Divine King of the Jiang family, once the pride of his generation. He was sealed away for many years, yet his divine might endured. When he returns, even the strongest powers of the world take notice."],
	"xu_yang": ["100,000 Years of Qi Refining", "A cultivator who spent a hundred thousand years at the Qi Refining stage. His humble realm hides an unfathomable depth of power, built up over countless ages. Calm and unhurried, he amazes everyone who judges him by his rank."],
	"chu_feng": ["Martial God Asura", "An outer disciple of a minor sect who awakened a lightning beast within him and the Heavenly Thunder bloodline. He rose through endless battles against arrogant young masters and ancient powers. Proud, loyal and relentless, he never lets an insult to his friends go unanswered."],
	"zhuo_fan": ["Magic Emperor", "A demon emperor betrayed and killed at the height of his power. He was reborn in the body of a humble steward serving a declining family. Using dark arts and ruthless cunning, he rebuilds his power while protecting the family that took him in."],
	"an_qingyu": ["Slay the Gods", "A calm, analytical genius who joined the Night Watch with a remarkable Forbidden Ruin. His power lets him analyse and take apart almost anything, from locks to living foes. Polite and precise, he becomes one of Lin Qiye's most trusted allies."],
	"black_emperor": ["Shrouding the Heavens", "A loud, greedy, foul-mouthed black dog of ancient lineage. He is a master of formations, able to build arrays that rival the work of great sages. For all his tricks and complaints, he stands loyally by Ye Fan's side."],
	"bo_saixi": ["Soul Land", "The high priestess of the Sea God, who has guarded the Sea God Island for countless years. Her power as a Limit Douluo is rivalled by few. Dignified and devoted, she oversees the trials that decide the Sea God's heir."],
	"cao_yuan": ["Slay the Gods", "A member of the Night Watch with a berserk Forbidden Ruin that gives him tremendous power. Controlling that power is a constant struggle. Loyal and straightforward, he fights beside his squad through every danger."],
	"chen_muye": ["Slay the Gods", "A captain of the Night Watch who has guarded his city for years in silence. He teaches the next generation what protecting people truly costs. Steady and responsible, he inspires those who serve under him."],
	"ling_qingzhu": ["Martial Universe", "A cold and elegant swordswoman of ice who carries a special destiny. Her path crossed Lin Dong's early on, and their fates became bound together. Reserved and determined, she grows into a formidable cultivator in her own right."],
	"nine_nether": ["The Great Ruler", "The proud queen of the Nine Nether Sparrow clan, fiery in both temper and power. She became an ally of Mu Chen and fought beside him through many battles. Fierce and loyal, she refuses to bow to anyone."],
	"shi_yi": ["Perfect World", "Shi Hao's cousin, born with the legendary Double Pupils. The supreme bone taken from Shi Hao was given to him, making him a genius of his generation. Proud and powerful, he must eventually face the reckoning of what was taken."],
	"zhao_layue": ["Path Toward Heaven", "A disciple of the Green Mountain with a pure, unwavering sword heart. She follows Jing Jiu and grows under his unusual guidance. Principled and stubborn, she walks the path of the sword with total sincerity."],
	"ying_huanhuan": ["Martial Universe", "A spirited young woman of Martial Universe with arts that bolster allies and unsettle foes. Lively and quick-witted, she often brings energy to her companions. She matures into a capable and confident cultivator."],
	"biyao": ["Jade Dynasty", "The gentle daughter of the Ghost King Sect's master, raised among the so-called evil path. She loved Zhang Xiaofan when the world turned against him. Her love and sacrifice became one of the most tragic legends of her world."],
	"li_muwan": ["Renegade Immortal", "A gifted alchemist whose path crossed Wang Lin's when he was still weak. She was one of the few people who showed him warmth, and she became the one gentle light in his long and bloody road. Her fate drove much of his later journey."],
	"lu_xueqi": ["Jade Dynasty", "The Qingyun Sect's peerless swordswoman, cold as frost and graceful beyond compare. She wields the Heavenly Frost Sword with unmatched skill. Beneath her distance lies a heart that never wavers once it chooses."],
	"luo_li": ["The Great Ruler", "The noble daughter of the Luo God clan, a swordswoman of great talent. Quiet and elegant, she is utterly loyal to Mu Chen. Her swordplay is as precise as her devotion is unwavering."],
	"nalan_yanran": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "The proud heir of the Misty Cloud Sect, who broke off her engagement with Xiao Yan when he seemed a failure. That moment of humiliation became the spark that set him on his path. She grows beyond her early pride as the years pass."],
	"nangong_wan": ["A Record of a Mortal's Journey to Immortality", "A refined and powerful cultivator of the Yanyue Sect, far above Han Li when they first met. Their fates became entwined in unexpected ways. Calm and dignified, she became one of the most important people in his life."],
	"ning_rongrong": ["Soul Land", "Princess of the Seven Treasure Glazed Tile Sect and a member of Shrek's Seven Monsters. Her pagoda spirit greatly strengthens every ally beside her. Spoiled at first, she grows into a loyal and caring companion."],
	"qing_lin": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "A shy snake-blooded girl born with the Emerald Snake Three Flowers Eyes. She can command serpents with a single glance. Xiao Yan took her in, and she has followed him loyally ever since."],
	"xia_qingyue": ["Against the Gods", "The icy heir of the Frozen Cloud Palace, calm and distant. Behind her composure lies a destiny tied to the moon god's throne. Few truly understand her, yet her quiet choices shape great events."],
	"xiao_yi_xian": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "Known as the Little Fairy Doctor, a kind-hearted girl cursed with a poison body. Her deadly gift is matched only by her gentle spirit. She became one of Xiao Yan's closest friends."],
	"xu_xin": ["Swallowed Star", "Luo Feng's childhood love and his steady support. Her warmth anchors him no matter how far across the stars he travels. She represents the ordinary life he fights to protect."],
	"ya_fei": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "The charming auctioneer of the Mitel family, clever and resourceful. She helped Xiao Yan in his early days, when few others did. Poised and sharp, she knows the value of everything and everyone."],
	"ye_ziyun": ["Tales of Demons and Gods", "A noble young lady of Glory City, graceful and quietly strong. Her bond with Nie Li spans two lifetimes. She is one of the people he is determined to protect this time."],
	"zhu_zhuqing": ["Soul Land", "A cool, silent member of Shrek's Seven Monsters. Her Netherworld Cat martial spirit strikes with blinding speed. Quiet but fiercely determined, she fights to change a harsh fate."],
	"hai_bodong": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "A veteran Dou Huang known as the Ice Emperor, once sealed away for many years. Xiao Yan helped free him from his seal. Grateful and gruff, he became a valuable ally."],
	"situ_nan": ["Renegade Immortal", "Wang Lin's first master, a fierce soul sealed inside the Heaven-Defying Bead. Ruthless and blunt, he taught Wang Lin the cruel truths of the cultivation world. Beneath his harshness lies deep loyalty to his disciple."],
	"baili_pangpang": ["Slay the Gods", "A wealthy, cheerful young recruit of the Night Watch. His deep pockets and unlikely Forbidden Ruin make him far more useful than he looks. Good-natured and loyal, he lightens every squad he joins."],
	"lei_wujie": ["Great Journey of Teenagers", "An eager, kind-hearted young hero of the Thunder Clan. He dreams of making a name for himself in the martial world. Honest and brave, he often rushes in where others would hesitate."],
	"lu_piao": ["Tales of Demons and Gods", "Nie Li's loyal friend, cheerful and brave. He follows Nie Li into every danger without a second thought. His optimism keeps spirits high even in the darkest moments."],
	"mo_caihuan": ["A Record of a Mortal's Journey to Immortality", "A daughter of the Mo family whose path crossed with Han Li's in his mortal days. She lives in a world far from immortals and flying swords. Her story reminds Han Li of the ordinary life he left behind."],
	"wang_zhuo": ["Renegade Immortal", "Wang Lin's cousin, gifted where Wang Lin was not. His early talent made him proud in his youth. His fate turned out very differently from what anyone expected."],
	"xiao_mei": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "A girl of the Xiao clan who grew up alongside Xiao Yan. She watched both his fall and his remarkable rise. Her memories are tied to the clan's early days in Wu Tan City."],
	"xiao_wu": ["Soul Land", "A spirited, cheerful rabbit girl who is, in truth, a hundred-thousand-year spirit beast in human form. She became Tang San's dearest companion from their earliest days. Her secret and her love both shape his entire journey."],
	"zhang_tie": ["A Record of a Mortal's Journey to Immortality", "Han Li's first friend among the Seven Mysteries Sect disciples. Hardworking and honest, he trained alongside Han Li in their mortal days. His fate left a lasting mark on Han Li."],
	"du_ze": ["Tales of Demons and Gods", "One of Nie Li's closest friends in Glory City. Quiet and hardworking, he rarely draws attention to himself. Under Nie Li's guidance, he grows far stronger than anyone expected."],
	"hong_ying": ["Slay the Gods", "A cheerful, fearless member of the Night Watch squad in Cangnan. She faces monsters from beyond with a grin. Her bright spirit keeps her squad going through dark times."],
	"hou_xiaomei": ["A Will Eternal", "Bai Xiaochun's childhood friend from his home village. She later sets out on the path of cultivation herself. Her ties to Bai Xiaochun's past remain dear to him."],
	"li_feiyu": ["A Record of a Mortal's Journey to Immortality", "A friend from Han Li's mortal days in the Seven Mysteries Sect. A spirited young martial artist with a warm heart. Their friendship is one of Han Li's earliest bonds."],
	"qingtan": ["Martial Universe", "Lin Dong's adopted younger sister, sweet and gentle. She carries a mysterious and dangerous bloodline. As it awakens, it changes her fate and tests her bond with her brother."],
	"su_baiyi": ["Jun You Yun", "A graceful cultivator in white, calm of manner and quick of mind. She studies the Dao with patience and quiet resolve. Her early days hint at the strength she will one day reach."],
	"chen_qiaoqian": ["A Record of a Mortal's Journey to Immortality", "A young lady of the Chen family whom Han Li met in his early cultivating days. Their brief time together left a deep impression on her. She never forgot him, even as their paths led far apart."],
	"du_lingfei": ["A Will Eternal", "A proud and beautiful disciple of the Spirit Stream Sect. Her path keeps crossing Bai Xiaochun's in unexpected ways. Talented and composed, she is far more than she first appears."],
	"ji_ziyue": ["Shrouding the Heavens", "A lively young lady of the powerful Ji family with a big appetite and a bigger heart. She met Ye Fan early in his journey and became one of his dearest companions. Playful and bold, she brightens every adventure."],
	"liu_mei": ["Renegade Immortal", "A proud genius who first appeared among the Xuan Dao Sect's disciples, alluring and supremely confident in her talent. She cultivated a heartless path of illusions, cutting away her emotions and using her charm as a weapon. Cold on the surface and scheming beneath, she plotted again and again to seize Wang Lin's Life and Death domain, and her bitter entanglement with him became one of the darkest threads of his journey."],
	"su_yan": ["Martial Peak", "A cool, ice-cultivating beauty with a gentle heart. She became one of Yang Kai's closest companions. Calm and steady, she supports him through countless trials."],
	"su_youwei": ["Yuan Zun", "Zhou Yuan's quiet, steadfast companion. Her calm manner hides a formidable inheritance. She stands beside him through every challenge on his path."],
	"xia_ning_chang": ["Martial Peak", "Yang Kai's gentle senior sister from the High Heaven Pavilion. A talented alchemist with an endlessly kind heart. She looked after him when he was still a lowly disciple."],
	"xin_ruyin": ["A Record of a Mortal's Journey to Immortality", "A gentle formation master Han Li met on his travels. She was far more at home with arrays and wards than with open battle. Her skill with formations proved invaluable to those she trusted."],
	"xiao_ninger": ["Tales of Demons and Gods", "A bright, spirited young lady of Glory City. Her friendship draws her into Nie Li's circle. Cheerful and brave, she adds warmth to every gathering."],
	"yun_xi": ["Perfect World", "A gifted and graceful young lady of the Celestial clans, gentle in manner and unshakeable in her devotion. She defied her own people to stand by Shi Hao when he was hunted and cursed, and chose to follow him even into the lower realm. Of everyone in his long life, she was the one who stayed beside him through two lifetimes."],
	"cao_yusheng": ["Perfect World", "A mysterious, plump young man who appeared from nowhere, with deadly killing formations carved into his very flesh and blood. Crafty, greedy and always ready with a scheme, he became Shi Hao's closest friend and sworn brother, fighting at his side through countless battles. His story reaches far beyond one era, and old friends may meet him again under a very different name."],
	"hong": ["Swallowed Star", "One of Earth's first great martial legends, who helped build humanity's path of cultivation. He guided Luo Feng in his early days. Bold and far-sighted, he is a pillar of Earth's strength."],
	"pang_bo": ["Shrouding the Heavens", "Ye Fan's loyal friend from Earth, carried with him to the new world. There he inherited the power of an ancient demon lineage. Big-hearted and dependable, he stands by Ye Fan no matter what."],
	"shan_qing_luo": ["Martial Peak", "Known as the Beguiling Demon Queen, one of the six Evil Kings of a lawless land, playful, seductive and ruthless towards anyone she dislikes. A cursed constitution bound her heart to Yang Kai after a chance encounter, and it nearly cost her life. Freed from that curse by him, she inherited the power of a divine moon spider and became one of his most loyal companions."],
	"song_junwan": ["A Will Eternal", "A proud and capable cultivator of the Blood Stream Sect. She became Bai Xiaochun's companion, and in time his love. Strong-willed and clever, she is his equal in every way."],
	"xiao_chen": ["World of Immortals", "A young man from Zulong Village on the Yellow River, who spent ten years training in martial arts after a childhood brush with an ancient river stele. At twenty he was driven up Kunlun Mountain by his pursuers and carried into the Immortal Realm, where he grew through bloody battles and countless trials, even returning from death more than once. Proud, sharp-witted and quick to avenge a wrong, he is fiercely loyal to his friends and will risk everything to protect them."],
	"xiao_diao": ["Martial Universe", "The Heavenly Demon Marten, a sly and ancient demon spirit. He travels with Lin Dong inside the Stone Talisman. Cunning and sharp-tongued, he is one of Lin Dong's most valuable allies."],
	"gongsun_wan_er": ["A Will Eternal", "A prodigy of the Spirit Stream Sect's North Bank, tall and dignified in an orange palace robe, admired for her talent and her striking phoenix eyes. Her fate changed forever in the Fallen Sword Abyss, where a mysterious ghostly power took hold of her and made her far stronger than before. Proud and formidable, she became one of Bai Xiaochun's most unusual and steadfast companions."],
	"huo_linger": ["Perfect World", "The fiery princess of the Fire Country, quick to anger and quicker to laugh. She has known Shi Hao since he was a village child. As she matures, her flames and her will grow ever stronger."],
	"qing_yi": ["Perfect World", "The Holy Maiden of the Heaven Mending Sect, whose birth lit up the heavens with auspicious signs. Sent to the lower realms to temper herself, she walked the world as a veiled traveller, gentle, warm and quietly brilliant. Her path became deeply entwined with Shi Hao's, and in time she broke from her own destiny to become a person entirely her own."],
	"thunder_god": ["Swallowed Star", "One of Earth's legendary powerhouses and a master of thunder. His strength shaped Luo Feng's early path. Proud and mighty, he stands among Earth's greatest."],
	"xie_yan": ["I'm an Evil God", "A young man from Earth, bored of his life there, who died in an accident and woke in a world of martial arts and cultivation. Trapped and in danger from the start, he survived on wit alone, aided by a mysterious system that lets him grow stronger and travel between worlds. Across many realms he fights gods, invaders and a terrifying Evil Deity, on the road to becoming an evil god of his own kind."],
	"yuan_yao": ["A Record of a Mortal's Journey to Immortality", "A ghost-path cultivator who shared many dangers with Han Li. Steadfast and loyal to her friends, she walks a path few understand. Her bond with Zi Ling is especially close."],
	"zhou_ru": ["Renegade Immortal", "Born in a quiet village with every meridian open and a purple glow about her, a talent so rare it drew dangerous attention. Wang Lin took her in and raised her himself, and the shy child grew lively and cheerful, calling him Uncle and playing with her white tiger companion, Little White. Determined never to be a burden to him, she cultivated tirelessly, hoping one day to find her Uncle Wang again."],
	"zi_ling": ["A Record of a Mortal's Journey to Immortality", "Born Wang Ning, she was called the most beautiful woman of the Chaotic Star Sea, a beauty that brought her more danger than fortune. After her parents were killed, she veiled her face, took the name Zi Ling from her purple robes and spirit bracelet, and rose to lead the Exquisite Sound Sect. Clever and resilient, she hired Han Li as a guest elder, and their fates stayed linked long afterwards."],
	"liu_shen": ["Perfect World", "The ancient willow that stood at the edge of Stone Village, charred by lightning, with only a single green branch left alive. To the villagers it was a guardian spirit; to Shi Hao it was a teacher and protector through his childhood. Its true origins reach back to ages long forgotten, and its power once shook the very heavens."],
	"tu_si": ["Renegade Immortal", "One of the ancient gods, a race of towering beings whose bodies held power beyond ordinary cultivation. His inheritance passed to Wang Lin and became a pillar of Wang Lin's strength, reshaping his body along an ancient path. Proud and immense, he is a relic of a lost age of giants."],
	"nyx": ["Slay the Gods", "The ancient goddess of night, mother of many gods, whose power once shaped the darkness itself. Wounded and weakened, she found refuge in the strange hospital within Lin Qiye's mind. Gentle towards him and terrifying to her enemies, her night can swallow armies."],
	"merlin": ["Slay the Gods", "The legendary wizard of old, one of the greatest spellcasters who ever lived. He came to rest in the strange hospital within Lin Qiye's mind, where he became one of his most extraordinary teachers. Playful and wise, his magic bends reality to his will."],
	"fengxiu": ["Throne of Seal", "The Demon God Emperor, ruler of the demon realm and the greatest threat to the human continent. His power holds the demon gods in check and keeps the world under the demons' seal. Cold, proud and immensely strong, he is the final wall before the humans' freedom."],
	"electrolux": ["Throne of Seal", "A towering figure of the Throne of Seal world, whose name alone commands respect among the strongest powers. Few have witnessed the full extent of this strength and returned to tell of it. Proud and formidable, this power stands at the pinnacle of that world."],
	"asura_god": ["Soul Land", "The God of Asura, lord of killing and judgment among the gods. His trials test a soul through endless slaughter and the weight of every life taken. Those who inherit his power carry a blade that cuts through anything that stands in their way."],
	"sea_god": ["Soul Land", "Poseidon, the Sea God, lord of the oceans and one of the most powerful gods of the divine realm. For countless years his island and its priests awaited an heir worthy of his trials. His trident commands the tides, and his blessing is a mark of true divinity."],
	"tang_hao": ["Soul Land", "Tang San's father, once the famed Clear Sky Douluo, who hid for years as a drunken village blacksmith. His Clear Sky Hammer was among the most feared weapons of his age. Grief-stricken yet fiercely protective, he returns in full power when his son needs him most."],
	"gu_yuan": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "The leader of the ancient Gu Clan and father of Xiao Xun'er, one of the strongest beings of his world. His golden flames and noble bloodline stand at the peak of the Dou Qi continent. Calm and dignified, he carries the weight of the ancient clans' long struggle."],
	"hun_tian_di": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "The Soul Emperor of the Soul Clan, a scheming master who worked in the shadows for ages. His ambition is to seize the power of the ancient clans and the legacy of the Dou Di. Patient, cunning and utterly ruthless, he is one of the greatest foes Xiao Yan ever faced."],
	"xiao_xuan": ["Battle Through the Heavens", "The legendary ancestor of the Xiao clan, a Dou Sheng of immense power from a glorious age. His legacy shaped the fate of his descendants long after his era ended. Proud and brilliant, he fought for his clan's glory to the very end."],
	"meng_tianzheng": ["Perfect World", "A peerless figure of Perfect World, remembered for talent and strength that towered over his age. His name carries weight among the great powers and ancient clans. Proud and unyielding, he stands as a legend in his own right."],
	"hen_ren_da_di": ["Shrouding the Heavens", "The Ruthless Empress, a girl from humble and bitter beginnings who became one of the most fearsome Great Emperors in history. Her cultivation was forged through suffering, and her path was driven by the search for the brother she lost. Cold and unstoppable, her legend echoes through the ages."],
	"wu_shi_da_di": ["Shrouding the Heavens", "The Beginningless Emperor, a Great Emperor so powerful that his era was one of unmatched peace and fear. His Beginningless Bell is among the most legendary weapons ever forged. Proud and unrivalled, he walked his path alone and then vanished into legend."],
	"black_dragon_tian": ["Wu Geng Ji", "A mighty being of the Wu Geng Ji world whose dark dragon power commands fear. He stands among the great powers who shaped the war between gods and mortals. Proud and dangerous, few dare stand in his way."],
	"qian_qu_demon_saint": ["Cang Yuan Tu", "A Demon Saint of the Cang Yuan world, one of the greatest powers among the monster races that threaten humanity. His presence alone can turn the tide of a war. Cold and overwhelming, he stands at the peak of the demons' might."],
	"che_hou_yuan": ["Stellar Transformations", "A Heavenly Venerable of Stellar Transformations, standing near the very top of the divine realms. His word carries weight among gods and immortals alike. Wise and immensely powerful, he watches the fate of the universe unfold."],
}

